en:
{p}
Is he going to fight them all by
himself!?

jp:
{p}
僕も行くよ！
あの巨人を見殺しには出来ない！

en:
{p}
I'm going too! We can't just let that
giant die!

jp:
{p}
なぜ…って たったひとりじゃ
殺されちゃうと思って…

en:
{p}
Why...? Well, I figured you'd get killed
all on your own...

jp:
{p}
そういえば
逞馬君は どうしたんだろ？

en:
{p}
Come to think of it, what happened to
Takuma-kun?

jp:
{p}
よし！ 僕も一緒に行くよ！
子供達を外道会から守ろう！

en:
{p}
All right! I'm coming with you! Let's
protect the kids from the Gedo Gang!

jp:
{p}
ドラゴンを率いている大男…
あれがスラムキング…！？

en:
{p}
The big man leading the Dragons... Is
that the Slum King...!?

jp:
{p}
しばらく ここは通れないよ…
別の道をさがそう

en:
{p}
We can't get through here for a
while... Let's find another way.

jp:
{p}
…これじゃ ここは通れないよ
別の道をさがそう

en:
{p}
...We can't get through here like this.
Let's find another way.
